:: cinema.caro.first-meeting -> @exit
  @place-key cinema
  @auto enter-place
  @priority 500
  @when npc.caro.present and npc.caro.schedule.obligationId == "caro_part_time_cinema"
  @when not npc.caro.met
  @onenter
    @effect relationship caro.rapport 1
    @effect set flags.npc.caro.cinema_encountered
  @endonenter

  The attendant behind the ticket counter is trying to restock a display of sweets without letting the queue see how precariously the boxes are balanced.

  She catches one against her hip, looks up, and gives you a quick, victorious smile. "Caro Novak. Welcome to the glamorous side of the film industry."

  You introduce yourself while she straightens the last box. Caro glances towards the programme board, then back to you as if filing your face alongside the week's films.

  @next "Nice save" -> @exit

:: place.cinema
  @hub cinema

  Backlit posters line the foyer of {{place.name}}. The smell of popcorn drifts from the concession stand while the screens rumble faintly beyond the ticket barrier.
